{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Report `$LATEST.PUBLISHED` as the executed version**\n\nThe testing runner explicitly preserves `$LATEST.PUBLISHED` as an executed version, but the shim maps every nonnumeric qualifier to `$LATEST`. Handlers invoked with this supported qualifier therefore observe a context inconsistent with the runner's execution details. Preserve this special qualifier and add it to the qualified-identifier tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM74B5Ce","finding_digest":"1a135e134340dbc2d6857ec8d93303c610ebeea845cfa7cde62350bfffb165bc","finding_id":"arf_v1_dijv4e2didn4fvufp3ensmydyy","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::runsandbox::latest-published-version","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::runsandbox::latest-published-version","line":279,"observation_digest":"662148b2310f46f231200bd92e2baf3b1e5316734971c21d158f48c082831372","observation_id":"aro_v1_myqurmrrb5dpemjabpms4k5phm","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-01T22:41:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kacf4myrr6apsummjtsffldknk","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"043d3decfcd46faf521f8cddcc42c0e71b110cc5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":279,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_bidlxwxobsoox5or7bt37b6jev"},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_ivjaq4jn7e6thgprwonps2q4oi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-01T22:41:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
